window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Something I never thought was capable, happened.<br> <br> Now I’m trying to make all these relationships work without letting my past effect my life.<br> <br> So I do what I do best, shove it down deep and distract myself with sex and blood.<br> <br> But I don’t have to worry about finding things to keep me busy because someone has come into my city, putting teenagers at risk.<br> <br> With the help of my men and Evie, we work together to track down each man who dears to stand against me.<br> <br> One by one, I collect my playmates for one of my most exciting and eventful D-Days to date.<br> <br> All while building new relationships and strengthening old ones.<br> <br> But how long can I ignore my trauma before it comes to bite me in the ass?<br> <br> I don’t know, but I hope they mean what they said, and are there for me no matter what. Because I don’t think I can do it without them anymore.</p>"; 
